# A multi-element [...] group expands into positions of the alternative,
# so it can only appear at the top level of a pattern, not inside a group.
# error: opt_group_in_group.grammar:24:21:
# error: a multi-element [...] group inside a group or choice is not supported
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    integer
    plus
    colon
    comma
    eq
    eof
    err
'+'                                         → plus
':'                                         → colon
','                                         → comma
'='                                         → eq
[0-9]+                                      → integer
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
top! = IDENT (PLUS [IDENT COLON]) INTEGER   → (t 1 3)
